le food items to residents of seattle offers home food delivery to those who are home bound occasionally provides pet food clients may visit the pantry once per week pre packaged bags of perishable and non perishable items pick up out front 722 18th avenue seattle king 98122 food pantry food pantries personal grooming supplies cleaning products commodity supplemental food program pet food fresh food formula baby food', 'byrdbarrplace.org', 0, 0, 'byrd-barr-place-food-pantry-seattle-58ef417e');
